https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nBoth `i1e` and `erfinv` return `0.0` for any float32 subnormal input. scipy returns correct nonzero results.\n\nQuick version: for small `x`, `i1e(x) ≈ x/2` and `erfinv(x) ≈ sqrt(pi)/2 * x`. So the output should be a subnormal roughly proportional to the input. JAX gives 0 for all of them.\n\n```python\n>>> from jax.scipy.special import i1e, erfinv\n>>> import jax.numpy as jnp, numpy as np, scipy.special as sp\n>>> x = np.float32(1e-40)\n>>> sp.i1e(x), float(i1e(jnp.float32(x)))\n(5e-41, 0.0)\n>>> sp.erfinv(x), float(erfinv(jnp.float32(x)))\n(8.86e-41, 0.0)\n```\n\nInputs at or above `np.finfo(np.float32).tiny` work fine.\n\n## Full reproducer\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nimport scipy.special as sp\nfrom jax.scipy.special import i1e as jax_i1e, erfinv as jax_erfinv\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\n\ntiny = np.finfo(np.float32).tiny\nxs = [np.nextafter(tiny, np.float32(0)), np.float32(1e-40), np.float32(1e-43)]\n\nprint(\"i1e:\")\nfor x in xs:\n    print(f\"  x={x:.2e}  scipy={sp.i1e(float(x)):.3e}  jax={float(jax_i1e(jnp.float32(x)))}\")\n\nprint(\"erfinv:\")\nfor x in xs:\n    print(f\"  x={x:.2e}  scipy={sp.erfinv(float(x)):.3e}  jax={float(jax_erfinv(jnp.float32(x)))}\")\n```\n\n## Expected output\n\n```\ni1e:\n  x=1.18e-38  scipy=5.877e-39  jax=5.877e-39\n  x=1.00e-40  scipy=5.000e-41  jax=5.000e-41\n  x=9.95e-44  scipy=5.045e-44  jax=5.045e-44\nerfinv:\n  x=1.18e-38  scipy=1.042e-38  jax=1.042e-38\n  x=1.00e-40  scipy=8.862e-41  jax=8.862e-41\n  x=9.95e-44  scipy=8.828e-44  jax=8.828e-44\n```\n\n## Actual output\n\n```\ni1e:\n  x=1.18e-38  scipy=5.877e-39  jax=0.0\n  x=1.00e-40  scipy=5.000e-41  jax=0.0\n  x=9.95e-44  scipy=5.045e-44  jax=0.0\nerfinv:\n  x=1.18e-38  scipy=1.042e-38  jax=0.0\n  x=1.00e-40  scipy=8.862e-41  jax=0.0\n  x=9.95e-44  scipy=8.828e-44  jax=0.0\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Likely cause: XLA's DAZ mode flushes subnormal inputs to 0.0, then evaluates at 0 (which happens to be 0 for both functions).\n- Same pattern seen in `jnp.log`, `jnp.sqrt`, other ops.\n- bfloat16 subnormals also affected. float16 is not.\n\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\njax:     0.10.1.dev20260513+64f6e229b\njaxlib:  0.10.0\nnumpy:   2.4.4\nscipy:   1.17.1\npython:  3.12.3\nOS:      Linux-6.14.0-37-generic-x86_64-with-glibc2.39\nbackend: cpu","closed_at":"2026-05-18T22:41:07Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37764/comments","created_at":"2026-05-18T20:56:31Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37764/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/37764","id":4472519460,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37764/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABCpU7JA","number":37764,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_coun